    GC_Briefing "{C686111008C849C4}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>  "\
     "We are the residential security detachment assigned to the Mayor's villa, currently located at GRID: 028049"\
     "Our force consists of 19 playable personnel and 10 AI.  "\
     "We are responsible for the protection of three VIPs, who must be safeguarded at all costs. "\
     "(Both civ and Iraqi security forces have similar briefs)"\
     ""\
     "A US Special Forces troop is currently en route from the south and may arrive by either air or ground.  "\
     "There is a radio at spawn which allows us to talk to BLUFOR. "\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>  "\
     "• 1x .50 cal KORD Humvee.  "\
     "• Various unarmed around the villa which might be useful when it comes time to flee."\
     "• 1x PKM turret positioned on the roof of the garage.  "\
     "• Fortified rooftop fighting positions providing elevated fields of fire.  "\
     "• A perimeter wall encloses the entire compound, with a known breach in the northern wall behind the swimming pool.  "\
     " "\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• A reinforced safe room for the VIPs is located on the first floor, along the main corridor. A locker inside contains helmets and body armour for the VIPs."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRAQ"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{C8C5125EB0AC6402}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>  "\
     "We are Myval Company, chosen to carry out this special mission.  "\
     "Our force consists of 53 personnel currently assembled at the staging area.  "\
     ""\
     "Once the operation begins, we will be able to deploy to any of the three insertion points marked on the map around the villa after 25 seconds using the doors next to us."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>  "\
     "• 7x reinforcements are standing by at the staging area and will deploy once casualties are sustained.  "\
     "• A supply crate is available at the staging area containing:"\
     "- 10x deployable ladders."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{30EA5D43C405D384}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>  "\
     "Enemy forces consist of a local Iraqi security detachment assigned to protecting the Mayor and his villa. Estimated strength is approximately 21 personnel.  "\
     ""\
     "They are responsible for the security of the Mayor and any additional HVTs located within the villa at GRID: 028049"\
     ""\
     "We should expect a rapid response from nearby government forces. They may attempt to reinforce the villa or extract the HVTs if the compound is compromised. Should the HVTs escape, every effort is to be made to PURSE and ELIMINATE them."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>  "\
     "• Prepared checkpoints and fortified fighting positions. Expect guards at the entrances, in watchtowers, patrolling the perimeter, and manning defensive positions along the walls, on rooftops, and throughout the compound.  "\
     "• Additional local security units are expected to respond as a quick reaction force.  "\
     "• A maid loyal to our cause has informed us of a reinforced safe room located on the first floor. Expect it to be heavily defended and difficult to breach."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{AFE2BF67D31630C7}" {
     m_iOrder 12
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2> "\
     "Move to the Mayor's villa, secure the VIPs, and extract them back to our staging area."\
     "Iraqi security forces are optional but may extract with us."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "The villa's residental security team has reported that a local street urchin arrived at the front gates of the compound, reporting that he witnessed groups of armed men gathering at multiple locations around the area."\
     "He claims to have heard chants of \"Death to the Mayor\" and describes the crowd as angry and growing in number."\
     "We have no further intelligence to confirm the report."\
     "Iraqi forces have stood to in preparation for a possible attack. We  have been contacted and  are preparing a pre-emptive QRF."\
     ""\
     "<b>- Interact with the radio on the table at the staging area to end the mission. This allows you to extract and secure rescued hostages while awaiting the arrival of others. The final mission outcome will be determined by the total number of hostages rescued when the mission is manually ended. Iraqi security forces may also use this radio.</b>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B6AE747F822998DC}" {
     m_iOrder 13
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2> "\
     "We are to shelter in place, listen to orders from our security forces, and await extraction from US special forces enroute."\
     "<b>- We are restricted to the villa's compound by AO limit until BLUFOR arrives. You'll recieve a hint once you can leave.</b>"\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "A local street urchin has arrived at the front gates of the compound, reporting that he witnessed groups of armed men gathering at multiple locations around the area."\
     "He claims to have heard chants of \"Death to the Mayor\" and describes the crowd as angry and growing in number."\
     "We have no further intelligence to confirm the report."\
     "The men have been stood to in preparation for a possible attack. US forces have been contacted and have confirmed they are preparing a pre-emptive QRF."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "CIV"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3C2F9D606EA15D0C}" {
     m_iOrder 14
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2> "\
     "Prepare for a possible imminent attack and hold your position until US Special Forces arrive to extract the Mayor and his two colleagues.  "\
     "Extraction of ourselves is secondary."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "A local street urchin has arrived at the front gates of the compound, reporting that he witnessed groups of armed men gathering at multiple locations around the area."\
     "He claims to have heard chants of \"Death to the Mayor\" and describes the crowd as angry and growing in number."\
     "We have no further intelligence to confirm the report."\
     "Stand to and man your positions in preparation for a possible attack. US forces have been contacted and have confirmed they are preparing a pre-emptive QRF."\
     ""\
     "<b>- We are restricted to the villa's compound by AO limit until BLUFOR arrives. You'll recieve a hint once you can leave.</b>"\
     "<b>- A radio is located on the table at the BLUFOR extraction area. If you extract with BLUFOR, interact with the radio to end the mission once at least one VIP has been successfully evacuated. This allows either BLUFOR or INDFOR to end the mission when they believe the maximum number of VIPs have been secured.</b>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRAQ"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{1FBFEF97EFA1017C}" {
     m_iOrder 15
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>  "\
     "We are to conduct a RAID on the Mayor's villa in order to ELIMINATE the Mayor and his political colleagues."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>  "\
     "Over the past week, our fighters have gradually infiltrated Al-Hadra without alerting government forces. The time has now come to strike."\
     "Our objective is to eliminate the city's political leadership, disrupt the upcoming regional elections, and spread fear throughout the population. Instability is essential to the success of our wider plans for the city."\
     "Advance with speed and aggression. Eliminate all resistance and complete the mission."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
